sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant VendorContract as VendorContract
    participant EventBus
    Client->>+VendorContract: terminate(reason)
    Note over VendorContract: Policies: vendorContractRead, vendorContractWrite, vendorContractExecute
    Note over VendorContract: Guards (2)
    VendorContract->>VendorContract: guard[0]: self.status == #quot;draft#quot; or self.status == #quot;active#quot;
    VendorContract->>VendorContract: guard[1]: self.deletedAt == null
    VendorContract->>VendorContract: mutate.status
    VendorContract->>VendorContract: mutate.terminatedAt
    VendorContract->>VendorContract: mutate.terminationReason
    VendorContract->>EventBus: emit VendorContractTerminated on vendor_contract.terminated
    VendorContract-->>-Client: void